PSE - Power Supply Emulator
===========================

Version: 1.0
Author: 4137314
License: GNU General Public License v3.0

Purpose
-------
PSE is a KiCad project designed to emulate power supply circuits
for testing and prototyping purposes. It includes both schematic
and PCB layout files suitable for educational and development use.

Installation
------------
To obtain the project, clone the repository using Git:

    git clone https://github.com/4137314/PSE.git
    cd PSE

Open the file "PSE.kicad_pro" in KiCad to access the full project.

Usage
-----
- Inspect the schematic via "PSE.kicad_sch".
- Review the PCB layout in "PSE.kicad_pcb".
- Generate manufacturing files (Gerber, BOM, Drill) if needed.

Ensure all libraries and footprints referenced by the project are
available in your KiCad environment.

